<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept rubber imports up 63.5 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept rubber imports up 63.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of natural rubber, including latex, in the first nine months were 360,000 tonnes, up 63.5 percent from the same period last year, the Futures Herald newspaper said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In September, imports of natural rubber, including latex, were 70,000 tonnes, it quoted customs figures as saying.</p>
<p>Imports of synthetic rubber, including latex, in January-September were 256,523 tonnes, up 16.3 percent from the same 1995 period, the newspaper said. Imports in September alone were 30,419 tonnes, it said.</p>
</text>
